{"5036510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Kreabordis", "steam_appid": 5036510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kreabordis is a laid-back strategy and puzzle game. Place creatures cleverly on the game board so that you score the most points at the end of a round. You can either play against the challengers and inhabitants of Kreabordis or test your skills in the Puzzle Mode. Forward thinking and tactical play are essential to mastering Kreabordis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challengers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eight residents of Kreabordis challenge you to test your skills. In the challenge mode, you play against one opponent at a time after creating a set of creatures. You then take turns placing them until the board is full. Whoever has the most points at the end wins the round. However, the challengers don’t give up easily and have even stronger creatures and tricks each round until they finally concede defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5036510/extras/089ab201983329908101ae2358fc8508.avif?t=1788217310\" alt=\"Kreabordis Board\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5036510/extras_big/089ab201983329908101ae2358fc8508.webp?t=1788217310 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But your creatures will also get stronger. If you’ve scored more points than your opponent at the end of a round, you can upgrade and swap out your creatures. However, to upgrade your creatures, you’ll need to play strategically each round, not only scoring points but also completing rows and columns to earn upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5036510/extras/b2d0e2abcafd67f60b3f159ce19c462f.avif?t=1788217310\" alt=\"Creature Selection\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5036510/extras_big/b2d0e2abcafd67f60b3f159ce19c462f.webp?t=1788217310 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master Kreabordis, find the perfect move, and become the Kreabordis champion. That’s the only way you’ll find out what the challengers are all about.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5036510/extras/4f836aa43e4daf2b2004862a7ec87542.poster.avif?t=1788217310\" aria-label=\"Perfect Move\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5036510/extras/4f836aa43e4daf2b2004862a7ec87542.webm?t=1788217310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5036510/extras/4f836aa43e4daf2b2004862a7ec87542.mp4?t=1788217310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the puzzle mode, you must score a predefined number of points using a given set of creatures on unusual board layouts. In this mode, there are no opponents and no surprises. Only a sound strategy and game plan will earn you a high score and the golden puzzle piece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5036510/extras/16efedd29aff338a14099fe044012f04.avif?t=1788217310\" alt=\"Puzzle Board\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5036510/extras_big/16efedd29aff338a14099fe044012f04.webp?t=1788217310 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In total, there are 10 different puzzles that get progressively more difficult and require different approaches to solve.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kreabordis is a laid-back strategy and puzzle game. Place creatures cleverly on the game board so that you score the most points at the end of a round. You can either play against the challengers and inhabitants of Kreabordis or test your skills in the Puzzle Mode. Forward thinking and tactical play are essential to mastering Kreabordis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challengers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eight residents of Kreabordis challenge you to test your skills. In the challenge mode, you play against one opponent at a time after creating a set of creatures. You then take turns placing them until the board is full. Whoever has the most points at the end wins the round. However, the challengers don’t give up easily and have even stronger creatures and tricks each round until they finally concede defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5036510/extras/089ab201983329908101ae2358fc8508.avif?t=1788217310\" alt=\"Kreabordis Board\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5036510/extras_big/089ab201983329908101ae2358fc8508.webp?t=1788217310 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But your creatures will also get stronger. If you’ve scored more points than your opponent at the end of a round, you can upgrade and swap out your creatures. However, to upgrade your creatures, you’ll need to play strategically each round, not only scoring points but also completing rows and columns to earn upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5036510/extras/b2d0e2abcafd67f60b3f159ce19c462f.avif?t=1788217310\" alt=\"Creature Selection\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5036510/extras_big/b2d0e2abcafd67f60b3f159ce19c462f.webp?t=1788217310 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master Kreabordis, find the perfect move, and become the Kreabordis champion. That’s the only way you’ll find out what the challengers are all about.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5036510/extras/4f836aa43e4daf2b2004862a7ec87542.poster.avif?t=1788217310\" aria-label=\"Perfect Move\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5036510/extras/4f836aa43e4daf2b2004862a7ec87542.webm?t=1788217310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5036510/extras/4f836aa43e4daf2b2004862a7ec87542.mp4?t=1788217310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the puzzle mode, you must score a predefined number of points using a given set of creatures on unusual board layouts. In this mode, there are no opponents and no surprises. Only a sound strategy and game plan will earn you a high score and the golden puzzle piece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5036510/extras/16efedd29aff338a14099fe044012f04.avif?t=1788217310\" alt=\"Puzzle Board\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5036510/extras_big/16efedd29aff338a14099fe044012f04.webp?t=1788217310 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In total, there are 10 different puzzles that get progressively more difficult and require different approaches to solve.</p>", "short_description": "Kreabordis is a puzzle game where you have to strategically place creatures on a board to score the most points. Defeat challengers, maximize your points in tricky puzzles and find the perfect move.", "supported_languages": "English, German", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5036510/92c840be057001785cfee4cbf300c4e7c19abd9d/header.jpg?t=1788217310", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5036510/1547ac428144d48935a81e295939e6f900f2cad8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788217310", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5036510/1547ac428144d48935a81e295939e6f900f2cad8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788217310", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 GHz Dual Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1 GB OpenGl<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 50 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 GHz Dual Core<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1 GB OpenGl</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</str